      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STRATEGY : \n\n1. Take a dummy Node \n\n2. To rotate the linked list , we have \nto move the pointer first to the initial node\n\n3. Start from the end and move by 2\n \n4. but we can't directly start from end \n\n5. get the lenght of linked list",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "STRATEGY : \n\n1. Take a dummy Node \n\n2. To rotate the linked list , we have \nto move the pointer first to the initial node\n\n3. Start from the end and move by 2\n \n4. but we can't directly start from end \n\n5. get the lenght of linked list",
